A '''Team Aqua Grunt''' (Japanese: '''アクアだんのしたっぱ''' ''Team Aqua Underling'') is a type of [[Pokémon Trainer]] that debuted in the [[Generation III]] {{pkmn|games}}. They are the peons of [[Team Aqua]]. They generally act as footsoldiers and guards for Team Aqua.

==In the games==
In {{game|Ruby and Sapphire|s|Pokémon Sapphire}} and {{pkmn|Omega Ruby and Alpha Sapphire|Pokémon Alpha Sapphire}}, they serve alongside the primary antagonists while in {{game|Ruby and Sapphire|s|Pokémon Ruby}} and {{pkmn|Omega Ruby and Alpha Sapphire|Pokémon Omega Ruby}}, they assist the player in stopping [[Team Magma]]. In {{game|Emerald}}, Team Aqua Grunts share the role of the antagonists alongside the {{tc|Team Magma Grunt}}s.

They generally use a combination of {{t|Water}}, {{t|Poison}}, and {{type|Dark}} {{OBP|Pokémon|species}}.

