==In animation==
===''Pokémon the Series''===
[[File:Team Aqua Agent.png|left|thumb|220px|Team Aqua Agent]]
[[File:Team Aqua Grunts anime.png|thumb|250px|Team Aqua Grunts in {{aniseries|RS}}]]
Team Aqua Grunts have made several appearances in ''Pokémon the Series: Ruby and Sapphire'', normally using their Pokémon to infiltrate a target or to help [[Shelly]] out.

The first Aqua Grunt debuted in ''[[AG017|Stairway to Devon]]'', where he infiltrated the [[Devon Corporation]] by disguising himself as a scientist and stole two capsules of "Creation Fluid". His plans were stopped by [[Team Rocket]]'s [[Jessie]] and [[James]], who intended to steal the same thing, all parties involved not realizing that "Creation Fluid" was nothing more than water. The same Grunt appeared again in [[AG018|the next episode]], where he used his {{p|Crawdaunt}} to capture [[Mr. Briney]]'s [[Peeko]]. Later, Team Rocket appeared to try and take Peeko from him, but were sent blasting off by Crawdaunt. He tried to escape with Peeko, but in the end, he was stopped and had to escape.

In ''[[AG027|A Three Team Scheme!]]'', three Grunts appeared with Shelly to collect information on Team Magma. They appeared again in ''[[AG054|Fight for the Meteorite!]]'', where they surrounded [[Professor Cozmo]] for a meteorite. They battled [[Team Magma]] and lost, but Team Magma's plans were ruined by Ash and Professor Cozmo. In ''[[AG083|Unfair Weather Friends]]'', they infiltrated the [[Weather Institute]], but their plans failed, and they had to escape. Their last appearances were in ''[[AG097|Gaining Groudon]]'' and ''[[AG098|The Scuffle of Legends]]'', where they had awakened {{DL|Kyogre and Groudon (Ruby and Sapphire series)|Groudon}}, causing mass destruction, but in the end, Team Aqua was defeated.

