===Pokémon Generations===
[[File:Team Aqua Grunt PG.png|thumb|250px|Team Aqua Grunts in [[Pokémon Generations]]]]
Team Aqua Grunts appeared in ''[[PG08|The Cavern]]'' alongside their leaders [[Archie]], [[Matt]] and [[Shelly]]. They were used as backup and general support for all of [[Team Aqua]]'s plans to reawaken {{p|Kyogre}}. Three accompanied Archie to the [[Seafloor Cavern]] as he used the [[Blue Orb]] on Kyogre, several appeared on board the [[Submarine Explorer 1]] alongside Archie and Shelly after Kyogre began to attack, and some were seen working with Matt as he reported on Kyogre's progress. In addition, many Grunts were seen in a flashback, attacking researchers at the [[Weather Institute]] during Team Aqua's takeover of the building.
