==In the manga==
===Ash & Pikachu===
Team Aqua Grunts appeared in ''[[SP23|Two Groups Attacking! Magma VS. Aqua]]'', where they were led by Shelly.

===Pokémon Adventures===
[[Matt]], [[Shelly]], and {{adv|Amber}} were originally Team Aqua Grunts during their debut. After successfully stealing the [[Devon Parts]], they were promoted to Admin status. The trio were assisted by other Team Aqua Grunts during their mission to end [[Mt. Chimney]]'s volcanic activity. Several other grunts then boarded the submarine to the [[Seafloor Cavern]] along with {{tc|Team Magma Grunt}}s.

In the {{MangaArc|Omega Ruby & Alpha Sapphire}}, grunts of both Team Magma and Team Aqua assist [[Zinnia]] during her raid on [[Sea Mauville]].

